# Validation-locked adjusted privacy results

The original 5% leakage target was infeasible for every model/seed. Values below use the predeclared detector-floor + 5 percentage-point diagnostic budget; they are not privacy guarantees.

| Split | Model | Irrelevant-character leakage | Relevant-character retention |
|---|---|---:|---:|
| test | minilm | 0.1827 ± 0.0257 | 0.4544 ± 0.0176 |
| test | distilbert | 0.1271 ± 0.0359 | 0.4775 ± 0.0694 |
| test | bert | 0.0956 ± 0.0077 | 0.3216 ± 0.1288 |
| reddit | minilm | 0.4755 ± 0.0388 | 0.4648 ± 0.0082 |
| reddit | distilbert | 0.3503 ± 0.1030 | 0.3885 ± 0.0765 |
| reddit | bert | 0.3299 ± 0.1286 | 0.3951 ± 0.1763 |
